# Flatpak permission/environment tweaks Matte OS applies system-wide after installing apps.
# One app per line: <app ID> <flatpak override options...>

# SONE (TIDAL) on NVIDIA under Wayland: WebKitGTK's DMA-BUF renderer crashes it ("Error 71"),
# so turn that renderer off. (Bit-perfect/exclusive mode also needs: --device=all; left to you.)
io.github.lullabyX.sone --env=WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1
